step 47 "cast 'chain lightning' drunk"
out cher "A lightning bolt leaps from your hand and arcs to the drunk.\n\rYour lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the drunk!\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe drunk hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the duck!\n\rYour lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the duck!\n\rThe duck is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rYou hear the duck's death cry.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the goblin!\n\rYour lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the goblin!\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rYou hear the goblin's death cry.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the beastly fido!\n\rYour lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the beastly fido!\n\rThe beastly fido is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe beastly fido's head is shattered, and his brains splash all over you.\n\rYou are struck by your own lightning!\n\rYour lightning devastates you.\n\rThat really did HURT!\n\rThe bolt grounds out through your body.\n\r\n\r<62hp 29910m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out god "\n\rCherub utters the words, 'chain lightning'.\n\rA lightning bolt leaps from Cherub's hand and arcs to the drunk.\n\rCherub's lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the drunk!\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rThe drunk hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the duck!\n\rCherub's lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the duck!\n\rThe duck is DEAD!!\n\rYou hear the duck's death cry.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the goblin!\n\rCherub's lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the goblin!\n\rThe goblin is DEAD!!\n\rYou hear the goblin's death cry.\n\rThe bolt arcs to the beastly fido!\n\rCherub's lightning does UNSPEAKABLE things to the beastly fido!\n\rThe beastly fido is DEAD!!\n\rThe beastly fido's head is shattered, and his brains splash all over you.\n\rThe bolt arcs to Cherub...whoops!\n\rCherub's lightning devastates him.\n\rThe bolt seems to have fizzled out.\n\r\n\r<100hp 29928m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
